    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop the noise... i don't even know what that means anymore. everything just feels heavy. it feels like there's nothing left of me anyway. just waiting for them to come and take what's left. is there even any dignity in just sitting here and waiting to be slaughtered?",
